# Internal service-to-service endpoints (/internal/*) are reached directly at
# mcp-manager:5000 on the docker network (agent-manager pull-at-launch) and are
# NEVER exposed here — this site forward-auths every external path except the
# healthcheck and the Authentik outpost callback.
